# Google Sign-In (native SDK, see src/services/googleAuth.ts)
# 1. Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID:
#    - One "Web application" client (its ID goes below) -- this is what Supabase's Google
#      provider and the ID token's audience both need.
#    - One "Android" client, with package name com.jemturk.crumbo and this app's release
#      signing certificate's SHA-1 fingerprint registered. No ID needs to be pasted anywhere
#      for this one -- the native SDK matches it automatically at runtime by package+fingerprint.
# 2. Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Google: enable it, paste the Web
#    client's Client ID + Client Secret there too.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=513830896320-572t9jgt2v01fvrhggsb3g7ftal7e175.apps.googleusercontent.com